              "chapter": "The Age of Revolutions"
            },
            {
              "id": "hist_industrial_revolution",
              "name": "The Industrial Revolution and Urban Transformation",
              "description": "Mechanization of production, steam engine, factory system, capitalist expansion, and demographic shifts",
